<p>He was among the three partners which purchased the flour mill in June 1899. Together with John Newton and led by Hiram Lyon, the Missouri Valley Milling Company grew to eventually own and operate three flour mills in Dickinson, Bismarck and its largest in Mandan. Stephenson served as the corporate treasurer through 1907. He held the position of the Mandan mill's manager through 1909. Russell-Miller Milling Company Mandan Mill (March 1925)</p>

