<p>He supported social organizations including the Minneapolis Athletic, Interlachen, Lafayette and Automobile Clubs. He remained life long friends with Hiram Lyon. Both men and their wives retired to the Pasadena, California. Stephenson died on January 27, 1925 in Pasadena. His wife Margaret died April 13, 1950 also in Pasadena. Both are buried the family cript in Lakewood Cemetery in Minneapolis, Minnesota.</p>
